{
  "tema": 10307,
  "slug": "echo-hecho",
  "titulo": "Echo vs hecho",
  "subtitulo": "Le echo sal. Ya está hecho.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "Echo, echas, echa (no h) come from echar (to throw, put in, pour): le echo sal. Hecho, hecha, hechos, hechas (with h) are the participle of hacer (done, made): ya está hecho. They sound the same.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Spelling",
            "From",
            "Meaning",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "echo, echas, echa, echan",
              "echar",
              "I throw / put / pour",
              "Le echo sal."
            ],
            [
              "hecho, hecha, hechos, hechas",
              "hacer",
              "done, made; a fact",
              "La tarea ya está hecha."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "They sound **identical**, so spelling is the only clue."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Hecho** is also a noun: **un hecho** (_a fact_), **de hecho** (_in fact_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Echar** appears in many expressions: **echar un ojo** (_keep an eye on_), **echarle ganas** (_give it your all_, very Mexican), **echar a perder** (_to ruin_)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **hacer** has an **h**, so its participle **hecho** keeps it."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "echo",
      "titulo": "Echo (echar)",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Siempre ==echo== los papeles en el bote de basura.",
              "en": "I always throw papers in the trash can."
            },
            {
              "es": "Nunca le ==echo== sal a la comida.",
              "en": "I never put salt on my food."
            },
            {
              "es": "Tranquila, yo les ==echo== un ojo a los niños.",
              "en": "Don't worry, I'll keep an eye on the kids."
            },
            {
              "es": "Le ==echo== ganas a todo.",
              "en": "I give everything my all."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "hecho",
      "titulo": "Hecho (hacer)",
      "bloques": [
        {
